    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-rootwight\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Undead / Plant · Elite Melee · CR 9 · XP 5,000</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Rootwight Enforcer</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">A wight rebuilt with orthogenic root-threading through its skeleton — Diane's preferred personal guard</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"The wight was adequate. The roots gave it purpose. The geometric threading gave it precision. Now it is correct.\" — D.C.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Rootwight Enforcer</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Medium undead (plant), neutral evil</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 9</span><span class=\"tag\">5,000 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Undead / Plant</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">16 (natural armor + root plating)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">136 (16d8 + 64)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">30 ft, climb 20 ft</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">18</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+4)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">14</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">18</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+4)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">10</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+0)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">13</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+1)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">8</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–1)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Saving Throws</div><div class=\"attr-val\">Str +8, Con +8, Wis +5</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Skills</div><div class=\"attr-val\">Perception +5, Stealth +6</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Resistances</div><div class=\"attr-val\">necrotic; bludgeoning, piercing, slashing from nonmagical weapons that aren't silvered</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Vulnerabilities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">fire (from plant component)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">exhaustion, poisoned</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">darkvision 60 ft, tremorsense 30 ft (while in contact with ground), passive Perception 15</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Root Regeneration</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">If the rootwight starts its turn in contact with earth, soil, or plant matter, it regains 10 hit points at the start of its turn, provided it has at least 1 hit point. Fire damage suppresses this trait until the start of the rootwight's next turn.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Geometric Symmetry</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The rootwight's form is unnaturally precise. When it makes melee attacks, it ignores half cover but not three-quarters cover. Creatures that witness the rootwight's movement must succeed on a DC 13 Wisdom save or be unsettled — they have disadvantage on their next saving throw against a druid or wizard spell this encounter (once per creature).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Anti-Druidic Presence</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">A druid who attempts to use Speak with Plants or Commune with Nature within 30 ft of the rootwight must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom save. On a failure, the spell fails and the slot is expended — the plants will not answer while the rootwight is present.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Multiattack</div><p class=\"action-desc\">The rootwight makes two attacks: one with its Root Slam and one with its Life Drain or Entangling Strike.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Root Slam</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +8 to hit, reach 10 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 15 (2d10 + 4) bludgeoning damage. If the target is Large or smaller, it must succeed on a DC 16 Strength save or be knocked prone.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Life Drain</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +8 to hit, reach 5 ft, one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 18 (4d8) necrotic damage. The target must succeed on a DC 16 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by the damage dealt. This reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The rootwight regains hit points equal to half the necrotic damage dealt.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Entangling Strike <em>(Recharge 5–6)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +8 to hit, reach 15 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 11 (2d6 + 4) piercing damage and the target is restrained by roots (escape DC 16 Strength). While restrained this way, the target takes 9 (2d8) necrotic damage at the start of each of its turns as the roots feed.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Create Rootwight Spawn</div><p class=\"action-desc\">A humanoid slain by the rootwight's Life Drain and left in contact with earth for 1 hour rises as an Orchard Zombie under Diane Clearwater's control.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
